{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not make MDC snapshot failures terminal workflow failures.** An ordinary failure from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is passed to `finishFailure`, producing durable `FAILED` before hooks or user code run. A transient logging-context problem can therefore permanently terminate the workflow. Treat capture as best-effort with a safe clearing baseline, or propagate it as an invocation retry without emitting a terminal response.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QxiT","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":270,"observation_digest":"8aeaa3370f5008f77e5f9922cc29313a88073eeabc4e46c8d2d0f6765a778b6a","observation_id":"aro_v1_rlvkgnypkaepo7s7termykjrhk","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:23Z","review_id":"arr_v1_u5vqjkgdlfisimzhmtii6vlizn","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7adb5a65e5e91e736325ca7e73781e22bfcf8a7e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":269,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_7kll44txsl23wz76y4temdoomi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:23Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
